      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 56084385790164992
    m_Localized: The new Mystling is hatching!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 56084385790164993
    m_Localized: "MICHA\u0141 UZUPE\u0141NIJ <3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 56085848704679936
    m_Localized: New Tamer Unlocked!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 56471210140631040
    m_Localized: I choose you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 56843005608443904
    m_Localized: Vitality Totem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57895615610298368
    m_Localized: Warning!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57895615635464192
    m_Localized: Due to changes in the game's content we have to reset your Tamer
      Level. Don't worry, we will compensate You with the same amount of Experience
      Points You had before the update.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57895615635464193
    m_Localized: First Victory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57895615635464194
    m_Localized: Congratulations, You just won Your first Run! Your journey doesn't
      end here, though. You have just unlocked a higher difficulty level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57895615635464195
    m_Localized: Thank You!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57895615635464196
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You have reached the maximum Tamer level.<br>Thank
      You for sticking out with our game!<br>But the game is not over! Make sure
      to try out every combination of Tamers and Mystlings and stop that Eclipse!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5093883885410844676
  - m_Id: 57944457445711872
